76\",\"snippet\":\" ... And the bitterness followed Chase so closely that Harmon had him booted from the show after that season! Per Deadline, tensions had been high between Chase and Harmon for a while as the production of the third season got into the swing of things. That included multiple prior ... \",\"title\":\"https://listverse.com/2024/10/15/10-actors-who-infamously-stormed-off-set-while-filming/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d77\"},\"ref\":\"d77\",\"snippet\":\" ... Harmon admits. \\\"My job was to say yes.\\\" Choosing a song by the 88 was also meaningful to Harmon because the character of Britta (Gillian Jacobs) was partially inspired by a \\\"super hip\\\" ex-girlfriend who introduced him to the band years earlier. \\\"Even just hearing [the song ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/tv/best-tv-theme-songs-21st-century/?srsltid=AfmBOooiefkeit4W3-Grk9msaAyUN4mDjUZ6MZvYMhGe2ByJjr6DKKtz\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d78\"},\"ref\":\"d78\",\"snippet\":\" ... It was also the home of the Comedy Central television series The Meltdown with Jonah & Kumail. Past performers include Louis C.K., Jim Gaffigan, Dan Harmon, Kumail Nanjiani, Jonah Ray, and Robin Williams.\\n\\nThe Showroom closed with Meltdown on March 31, 2018, after the building's owners sold ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nerdist\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d79\"},\"ref\":\"d79\",\"snippet\":\" ... We the 100 Million\\\"\\n\\nDirector/Producer: Jason R.A. Foster\\n\\nProducer: Michael \\\"Quess?\\\" Moore, Jeremy Liu\\n\\nMexico, USA | 2021 | 1 hr 9 min | 13+\\n\\nFriday, Oct. 22 10:30am Wilke\\n\\n\\\"Many Fires This Time: We