, Natalie Wood and Brittany Murphy are talked about just as much for their controversial deaths as they are for their bodies of work. Thelma Todd died under suspicious circumstances in 1935; almost 100 years later, people continue to speculate about what really happened to the young ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/tragic-deaths-actresses/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d83\"},\"ref\":\"d83\",\"snippet\":\" ... Further theatre and film roles\\n\\nMurphy returned to the stage starring opposite Neve Campbell at the New Ambassadors Theatre in London's West End from November 2006 to February 2007, playing the lead role of John Kolvenbach's play Love Song. Theatre Record described his character of Beane ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cillian_Murphy\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d84\"},\"ref\":\"d84\",\"snippet\":\" ... Personal life\\n\\nBrosnan has married twice, having been widowed once, and has five children and four grandchildren. He met Australian actress Cassandra Harris through David Harris, the nephew of Richard Harris, shortly after leaving drama school. On meeting her, he said, \\\"What a beautiful-looking woman. I never ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pierce_Brosnan\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d85\"},\"ref\":\"d85\",\"snippet\":\" ... Not only was it originally a high-concept sci-fi, but movie star Eddie Murphy was meant to have a meaty part alongside John Belushi and Dan Aykroyd. (The movie was basically meant for SNL guys to have some laughs catching ghosts.)\\n\\nMurphy passed on the gig, deciding ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.gamesradar.com/32-actors-who-turned-down-iconic-roles/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d86\"},\"ref\":\"d86\",\"snippet\":\" ... Eddie Murphy was in full control at this point, starkly evident in Coming to America's John Landis' coasting direction.\\n\\nSynopsis: Prince Akeem (Eddie Murphy) is the prince of a wealthy African country and wants for nothing, except a wife who [More]\\n\\nDirected By:\\n\\nJohn Landis\\n\\n#129\\n\\nCritics ... \",\"title\":\"https://editorial.rottentomatoes.com/guide/140-favorite-80s-movies/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... ve Lost Through the Years\\nauthor: John Russell\\ndate: 2025-02-16\\n---\\nSince its 1975 premiere, Saturday Night Live has featured more than 100 cast members, many of whom have gone on to become major stars in their own right. Think Chevy Chase, Eddie Murphy, Adam Sandler, Tina ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/saturday-night-live-stars-who-have-died-9257836\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"328843620bc2f06ebcd32b03bd74bfcd62abee5d0beac5cd88021697f0cb62d6\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"14bab0c9e4e5e0d5bd0ff7d0df4e5772a910e339534bf7e5cb5a01804a66a5ab\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"The 100 Murphy John Murphy character married children\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_7bdb88c2fa5948598aa8cb64"},{"content":"I have strong evidence that the answer involves Richard Harmon (plays John Murphy in \"The 100\") and his real-life sister Jessica Harmon (plays Niylah). Now I need to verify the specific clues about the character's marriages, children, and Richard Harmon's height. Let me search for these details.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"John Murphy The 100 character marriages Emori wife\", \"Richard Harmon actor height\", \"The 100 TV series seasons 7 premiere 2014\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_93381a8214ab4136812b406e","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"John Murphy The 100 children son daughter\", \"Murphy Emori The 100 married relationship\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_bdb024a68db34684afef6592","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d75\"},\"ref\":\"d75\",\"snippet\":\" ... for the 100, and even instructs Clarke Griffin and Jasper Jordan on how to rig the dropship to \\\"blast off\\\" in the Season One finale.\\n\\nDuring the second season, Raven struggles with nerve damage in her left leg from a gunshot injury she received when John Murphy shot ... \",\"title\":\"https://the100.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Reyes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d87\"},\"ref\":\"d87\",\"snippet\":\" ... John Chuldenko\\n\\nFollowing his divorce from first wife Judy Langford, Jack Carter married Elizabeth Brasfield, which made him the stepfather of her two children, John Chuldenko and Sarah Chuldenko Reynolds.\\n\\nJohn Chuldenko is a screenwriter and director. He is the creator of the television series \\\"Backseat Drivers\\\" and ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.today.com/parents/jimmy-carter-rosalynn-carter-children-grandchildren-rcna101303\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ra